@startuml
title Sơ đồ Triển khai Production Hệ thống BrewLite (UML Deployment Diagram)
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam nodeBorderColor #2B6CB0
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam componentBorderColor #2D3748
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EBF8FF
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #E6FFFA
skinparam databaseBorderColor #319795

cloud "Internet Public Network (HTTPS / TLS 1.3)" as Internet

node "Client Device\n(Smartphone / Laptop)" as ClientDevice {
  artifact "Web Browser / PWA\n(Mobile-first UI)" as Browser
}

node "Frontend Hosting Platform\n(Vercel / Render Edge)" as FrontendHost {
  component "Next.js Web Service\n(Port 443 -> SSR/Static)" as WebApp
  component "Global Edge CDN\n(Caching Assets)" as CDN
}

node "Backend Cloud Platform\n(Render / Railway Managed)" as BackendHost {
  node "API Docker Container\n(Linux Alpine Node.js)" as APIContainer {
    component "NestJS REST API\n(Port 3001)" as NestAPI
    component "Health Check Endpoint\n(GET /health)" as HealthCheck
    component "Prisma Client ORM" as PrismaClient
  }
}

node "Database Cloud Provider\n(Supabase / Render Managed DB)" as DBHost {
  database "PostgreSQL 16 Engine" as PostgresDB {
    folder "Persistent Storage Volume\n(Encrypted at rest)" as DBStorage {
      artifact "Tables: Users, Products,\nOrders, Payments, Seed" as DBData
    }
  }
}

node "CI/CD & Delivery Environment\n(GitHub Actions Runner)" as CIHost {
  component "Continuous Integration\n(Lint, Test, Build)" as CI_Runner
  component "Continuous Delivery\n(Deploy Trigger via Secret)" as CD_Runner
}

' Connections
Browser --> Internet : HTTPS / JSON
Internet --> CDN : HTTPS Request (Port 443)
CDN --> WebApp : Route Request
Browser --> Internet : REST API Calls
Internet --> NestAPI : HTTPS Reverse Proxy (Port 443 -> Port 3001)

NestAPI ..> HealthCheck : monitors
PrismaClient --> PostgresDB : SSL/TLS Encrypted Connection\n(DATABASE_URL, Port 5432)
PostgresDB --> DBStorage : Read/Write transactions

CI_Runner --> BackendHost : Build & Verify Artifacts
CD_Runner --> BackendHost : Trigger Production Deploy\n(Deploy Hook / SSH / Secret)
CD_Runner --> FrontendHost : Trigger Frontend Deploy

note right of BackendHost
  <b>Security & Config:</b>
  - JWT_SECRET (Hidden)
  - DATABASE_URL (SSL Mode)
  - CORS_ORIGIN restricted
  - Health check ping: 30s
end note
@enduml
